Subject: [PATCH 8/9] Q and K norm+rope of a layer run as one launch
 (rms_norm_mul_rope_f32_qk_pair, Q blocks then K blocks with its cache
 writes); qwen3moe expands V and the raw K projection before the Q norm so the
 two chains are adjacent (the V matmul reused the freed Q projection buffer in
 between). Bit-identical; Qwen3-30B tg128 +3.9 %, Qwen3.6 +1.1 % on 7900 XTX.
 GGML_CUDA_ROPE_QK_PAIR=0 / LLAMA_QK_ADJACENT=0 off

